{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#card-zh","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desk Pet 是 macOS 上的 DSH 桌面宠物，在独立的 AppKit 常驻窗口中显示 agent 状态。它读取本地活动信号，把空闲、工作、等待、报错、完成和睡眠状态显示为动画表情。点击可查看近期会话，右键可切换五种内置皮肤、免打扰和 Dock 或菜单栏显示，也能检查更新。适合想在桌面随时了解 DSH 运行情况并快速查看会话的用户。需要 macOS、Python 3 与 DSH web profile；不需 API key，更新检查会访问 npm registry。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:60-98","src/dsh_desk_pet/app.py:226-328","src/dsh_desk_pet/observer.py:155-215","src/dsh_desk_pet/skins.py:112-130","src/dsh_desk_pet/updates.py:75-96"]}
